        <div class="hero hero-split">
          <div class="hero-text">
            <div class="eyebrow">Therapy &amp; Counseling · Coaching &amp; Supervision</div>
            <h1>Creating space for growth, together.</h1>
            <p>Growth needs open exchange and a fresh outside perspective. When facing challenges in your private or professional life, I support you in discovering new clarity and room to maneuver.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="hero-photo"><img src="{{ '/assets/img/stefan-gowitzke.jpg' | url }}" alt="Photo of Stefan Gowitzke"></div>
