            <p>As a certified systemic therapist and counselor, coach and supervisor, I accompany people through processes of reflection and development. I pass on my knowledge and practical experience as a certified teacher of systemic therapy and counseling.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="about-quote"><span class="mark mark-open">&ldquo;</span><p>We can learn something new at any time – if we believe that we can.<span class="mark mark-close">&rdquo;</span></p><cite>Virginia Satir</cite></div>
        </div>
